This repository is apesonape.io.

Read docs/AOA_REDESIGN_BRIEF.md before making major UI changes.

Core rules:

- Preserve all existing functionality.
- Never mock real integrations when an existing integration exists.
- Never expose secrets or move server environment variables client-side.
- Preserve Glyph authentication.
- Preserve wallet/ApeChain functionality.
- Preserve NFT collection and rarity functionality.
- Preserve SoundCloud, Spotify and AOA Radio functionality.
- Preserve Studio/IPFS publishing.
- Preserve Wardrobe.
- Preserve Arcade and leaderboards.
- Maintain mobile usability.
- Maintain accessibility.
- Do not invent statistics, live users, live broadcasts or activity.
- Avoid generic Web3/SaaS styling.
- The visual concept is "The AOA Signal": underground radio + ApeChain culture + arcade + terminal.
- Run lint, typecheck and production build after substantial changes.
- Fix errors instead of merely reporting them.